        "original_id": "4e078ef7-ac9f-500e-aad4-99c84e549487",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Newcastle United F.C., Premier League, EFL Championship, FA Cup, EFL Cup, UEFA Europa League\n- Seasons/Events: 2017–18 Newcastle United F.C. season, 2017–18 FA Cup, 1992 Premier League formation, 2018–19 UEFA Europa League\n\nFacts:\n- The Premier League was formed at the start of the 1992 season.\n- The 2017–18 season was Newcastle United F.C.'s first season back in the Premier League after promotion from the EFL Championship in the previous season.\n- The 2017–18 season was Newcastle United F.C.'s 23rd season in the Premier League.\n- In the 2017–18 season, Newcastle United F.C. participated in the Premier League, the EFL Cup, and the FA Cup.\n- The winner of the 2017–18 FA Cup qualified for the 2018–19 UEFA Europa League group stage.",
